    {
      "id": "p0209-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Historically, manzai is approximately 1000 years old, but modern-day manzai emerged from Osaka in the early 1900s. From there, Osaka-style manzai spread to the rest of Japan via stage, radio, and other forms of entertainment.",
        "raw": "Historically, manzai is approximately 1000 years old, but modern-day\nmanzai emerged from Osaka in the early 1900s. From there, Osaka-style\nmanzai spread to the rest of Japan via stage, radio, and other forms of\nentertainment.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.11765937,
          0.7591,
          0.66688271,
          0.82128571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.11633242,
          0.75838571,
          0.66820966,
          0.82235714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          40,
          41,
          42,
          43
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "漫才的历史约有一千年，不过现代漫才是在 20 世纪初的大阪成形的。此后，大阪式漫才通过舞台、广播等娱乐形式传遍日本。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
