    {
      "id": "p0209-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Today, manzai corporations play a major part in the Japanese entertainment industry by cultivating and introducing new talent. As such, many Japanese actors, singers, television hosts, and other celebrities begin their careers by making a name for themselves on the national manzai circuit.",
        "raw": "Today, manzai corporations play a major part in the Japanese entertainment\nindustry by cultivating and introducing new talent. As such, many Japanese\nactors, singers, television hosts, and other celebrities begin their careers by\nmaking a name for themselves on the national manzai circuit.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.11578123,
          0.83377857,
          0.67645714,
          0.89665
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.11445428,
          0.83306429,
          0.67778409,
          0.89772143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          44,
          45,
          46,
          47
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "如今，漫才公司通过培养、推出新人，在日本娱乐业扮演重要角色。因此，不少日本演员、歌手、电视主持人和其他名人，都是先在全国漫才舞台上闯出名气，再展开事业。",
        "status": "draft",
